{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:09:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7bb4a4e40af647bf8b556245b8cd7ab2","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1b27170cff80c1d0ab3195277abc8e6a772ee1e06f9ab06cdc70a865c8064b81","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"maxktz/hitch@bcbfca260225 snapshot a239af80cda50b58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7dd811b17fdd5c14cbbead10afbd8a3e788e9c58ba908b339d2f544cedaab5a2"],"source_ids":["src_51665feb7651590dad68b90b8932db8d"],"text":"Hitch is not a terminal multiplexer UI like tmux; the terminal feels like a normal shell while Hitch proxies input/output, records context, and exposes agent-friendly commands.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:09:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7bb4a4e40af647bf8b556245b8cd7ab2"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:09:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7bb4a4e40af647bf8b556245b8cd7ab2","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2b50d452eefc34b43471e6de22d31a722a804fe8e38b6eeb3fdda4c1b6459d56","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"maxktz/hitch@bcbfca260225 snapshot a239af80cda50b58","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_00e1e8028eca65660c1d64f11757d6c6d92bdabd37505d77b45587e084118978","slc_36d47b0744e428df5dc2a03a4c514ca871e075ba7c43058872a73e5925f0c4b3","slc_98e673b1c6378a49cc99aca8ce211531a18b3880b3cd74c5ce97aa414bda4f42"],"source_ids":["src_549d3fc0112e5f72992f5f86e5f05550"],"text":"`hitch send-keys -t <terminal>` sends input to a terminal, supports keys like Enter, Tab, C-c, and options including --wait finish/quiet/time/output, --timeout (default 30s), --tail, and --force.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:09:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7bb4a4e40af647bf8b556245b8cd7ab2"}
